    "body": "> Hmm, what would go in `content=\"\"`? Maybe there's an existing ontology with broad support that could be referenced, instead of inventing something anew.\n\nI'd propose we start with the ontology Simon linked, accepting both values. But I am open to expanding the ontology to something more descriptive of the nature of the content or that more closely aligns with new OS signals.",
