    "body": "> Needs some details as to whether this should work for nested documents and such and what this would look like if the document has a relationship with a popup or some such. Probably want to require a BCG swap of sorts.\n\nI'd say it should work for nested documents, but only affect the nested document. I hadn't thought of forcing a BCG swap, I was leaning on the navigation being cross-origin. How is the BCG swap observable?",
