    "created_at": "2025-11-13T05:34:12Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-11-13T05:35:02Z",
    "body": "An easy signal from the browser to the site about a known underage user [e.g. due to the age setting being applied that California now wants](https://www.politico.com/news/2025/10/13/california-law-online-age-checks-00606115) could be a simple HTTP header. It might also help to try to nudge [Linux desktops to support specifying an optional account age](https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xdg/xdg-specs/-/issues/226).",
